# Macabre Waltz (CR 608.2c, 701.9): "Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand, then discard a
# card." Two Entombs bury Memnite and Ornithopter; the Waltz returns both and Bot1 then discards the Island of the three cards
# in hand, keeping the creatures.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Entomb
Entomb
Macabre Waltz
Island
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Macabre Waltz.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite; Bot1.Graveyard.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Memnite; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Macabre Waltz; Island; Entomb; Black Lotus; Entomb
